        <notes><![CDATA[Transitive log4j-api (Spring AI); NivroOS logging is Logback+SLF4J only, the log4j-api implementation path is never activated. Bumping the transitive version needs review (soft gate)]]></notes>
        <packageUrl regex="true">^pkg:maven/org\.apache\.logging\.log4j/log4j-(api|to-slf4j)@2\.24\.3$</packageUrl>
        <cve>CVE-2026-34479</cve>
